# Helios no longer reads Supabase config from env vars.
#
# The Vault's Supabase connection (project URL + anon key) is now entered
# in-app: open the auth modal from the sidebar "Sign in" pill → "Connect"
# step, paste the URL + anon key your project admin gave you, then sign in.
# The values persist locally (localStorage) so you only enter them once per
# machine. The shipped binary ships with no baked-in connection on purpose,
# so different installs can point at different Supabase projects.
#
# (Logs and CFD work without any connection at all.)
